          <span class="m-chip"><b>🤖</b>AI Analysis</span>
          <span class="m-chip"><b>⌚</b>Live BPM & SpO₂</span>
          <span class="m-chip"><b>📈</b>Trend Alerts</span>
          <span class="m-chip"><b>💊</b>Medicine Reminders</span>
          <span class="m-chip"><b>🛡️</b>Emergency Card</span>
          <span class="m-chip"><b>🧠</b>24/7 Assistant</span>
